    "interpretation": "The harmful update direction changes actions monotonically with interpolation alpha. The earliest flips are concentrated in low-parent-margin states and in states where the parent selects a playable card; most of those flips replace the parent action with end turn. Alpha 0.05 disagreement is nearly uniform across registered battle indices, so the evidence supports an action-family ranking guard rather than a battle-specific patch."
